  <section class="section dark" id="ai-search">
    <div class="container two-col">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">AI search &amp; GEO</p>
        <h2>Check the information <span>AI answers use about your business</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">When a prospective customer asks an AI assistant about your service, product or location, the answer is assembled from what your pages say. We check that a clear, approved answer exists on the website and that the same facts appear on the pages used for AI-search monitoring.</p>
        <p>Regulated sectors raise the bar. Fintech pages need clear eligibility, product limitations and integration details, and we work only from information your team approves. <a href="/case-studies/ai-fintech-saas-geo/">Read the related fintech AI-search review</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timezone-card">
        <h3>What an AI-search review covers</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Referral sources</strong>: identifiable visits from AI platforms, reported separately from organic search</li>
          <li><strong>Answer samples</strong>: agreed questions, platforms and observation dates</li>
          <li><strong>Completed actions</strong>: the event and its destination are verified before anything is counted as an enquiry</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section darker" id="industries">
