      <div class="section-head centered">
        <p class="eyebrow">Sector experience</p>
        <h2>Specialist SEO for <span>your industry</span></h2>
        <p>A product comparison, a property listing and a local service page answer different buying questions. Each specialist service below explains the page work that sector needs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="industry-grid">
        <article class="card"><h3><a href="/football-soccer-seo-services/">Football &amp; sports</a></h3><p>Club-management software has to explain team administration, fixtures and reporting separately, with a clear path to try the product. <a href="/case-studies/football-app-seo/">TeamStats</a> is our published football case.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3><a href="/home-services-seo/">Home services &amp; trades</a></h3><p>Enquiry-driven SEO for the firms UK homeowners search for first: heating, electrics, roofing, clearance and pest control, where ThermoPest is our published case.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3><a href="/real-estate-seo-services/">Property &amp; real estate</a></h3><p>Listings visibility, local landing pages and authority building for agents, portals and property platforms.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3><a href="/finance-crypto-seo-services/">Finance &amp; fintech</a></h3><p>Finance content needs approved claims, named expertise and stated product limitations. Your compliance team reviews regulated statements; SEO work does not establish regulatory approval.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3><a href="/gaming-seo-services/">Gaming</a></h3><p>Search strategy for gaming brands in UK niches where releases move fast and content dates quickly.</p></article>
