        <p>Bright Forge SEO was founded by Ben Lowe together with co-founder Sassin Lowe. Ben has worked in SEO for more than 15 years, holds a marketing degree from London Metropolitan University and leads strategy and senior review. Campaigns are delivered by our team in Quezon City, Philippines, with Jani A. Cañonero as Head of Team and Jewe O. Manalo as an SEO specialist. Meet everyone on our <a href="/about-us/">about us page</a>, or see the scope of our <a href="/seo-services-philippines/">SEO services in the Philippines</a>.</p>
