        <p class="lead">Manila is eight hours ahead of GMT and seven ahead of BST. Our office hours are Monday to Friday, 9:00 to 18:00 Manila time, so we agree a useful overlap between your morning and our late afternoon.</p>
        <p>Send the brief, the access and the approval requirements before the agreed delivery window. We return completed work or questions at the scheduled checkpoint. The time difference lets your team review work during its own day; it does not turn an audit or a fix into an overnight job.</p>
